2026-11-02T13:44:09.7528410Z # `unittest discover` exits 0 when it finds no tests at all, so a
2026-11-02T13:44:09.7528648Z # renamed test directory would report green having run nothing. Count
2026-11-02T13:44:09.7528882Z # them and fail below the expected floor instead.
